{"id": "70496", "title": "莫愁", "author": "关就", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 27, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/70/70496/70496s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70496.htm", "intro": "有些人没办法不爱，有些人没办法不恨。\n    16岁，在这片生我养我的土地上，已经没有一盏灯是为我而亮。\n    17岁，我第一次发现人性如此黑暗，我开始排斥学校，甚至害怕被报复。一夜长大。\n    18岁，师兄，很多人喜欢你，但是没有人像我一样，想和你永远在一起。\n    19岁，那些我偷望过的人，都不曾为我停驻，我曾经苦苦等待谁的回眸，可是，总是空欢喜一场。\n    20岁，这一年的悲伤，已经汇成河水，淹没了我所有对于幸福的遐想。", "base": "files/article/html/70/70496", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "第一", "file": "10985207.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二", "file": "10985208.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三", "file": "10985209.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四", "file": "10985210.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五", "file": "10985211.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六", "file": "10985212.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七", "file": "10985213.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八", "file": "10985214.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九", "file": "10985215.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十", "file": "10985216.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十一", "file": "10985217.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二", "file": "10985218.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十三", "file": "10985219.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十四", "file": "10985220.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十五", "file": "10985221.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十六", "file": "10985222.html", "available": true}, {"title": "十七", "file": "10985223.html", "available": true}, {"title": "十八", "file": "10985224.html", "available": true}, {"title": "十九", "file": "10985225.html", "available": true}, {"title": "二十", "file": "10985226.html", "available": true}, {"title": "二十一", "file": "10985227.html", "available": true}, {"title": "二十二", "file": "10985228.html", "available": true}, {"title": "23-28", "file": "10985229.html", "available": true}, {"title": "最新更新", "file": "10985230.html", 